{"parentUuid":"a71cc18a-6dfd-465d-80e5-1c02bc3726c6","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a486d3f9206a2b09a","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01LVFtw83YD7WVuWwAeJZcHi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UjxtkoL4EQsuFXEVNXTMrG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"tail -c 8000 /home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/aa2cd8e2e60b20719.output","description":"Read tail of transcript for final verdict"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1737,"cache_read_input_tokens":26502,"output_tokens":342,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1737},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":342,"cache_read_input_tokens":26502,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1737,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1737,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CasSC2RW2tXuys61FBT2x","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"c8bd1486-63e7-413d-a1d3-3f756abee979","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:03:14.629Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c8bd1486-63e7-413d-a1d3-3f756abee979","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a486d3f9206a2b09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UjxtkoL4EQsuFXEVNXTMrG","type":"tool_result","content":"�但 IPC 更高 | 平台切换成本高 |\\n\\n**Round 2/4 的 +15~35% 加速来源拆解（自我估计）**：Linux 调度/glibc malloc +5~10%，编译器路径 +6~15%（march+LTO+PGO 累加），其余来自 NUMA/THP/CPU governor。**Windows 自编 OR-Tools 能拿到的部分约 +8~15%（march+LTO+PGO 不靠 OS）**。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 自编 OR-Tools 9.15 + PGO 操作清单（Linux 优先，Windows 也走通）\\n\\n### Linux + Clang 18 路径（推荐）\\n\\n```bash\\n# 0. 准备\\ngit clone -b stable https://github.com/google/or-tools && cd or-tools\\ngit checkout v9.15\\n\\n# 1. Stage 1: instrumented build\\ncmake -S . -B build_pgo_gen -G Ninja \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DBUILD_DEPS=ON \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=clang-18 -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++-18 \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS=\\\"-O3 -march=native -mtune=native -fprofile-generate=/tmp/ortools_prof -DNDEBUG\\\" \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS=\\\"-fprofile-generate=/tmp/ortools_prof\\\" \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_SHARED_LINKER_FLAGS=\\\"-fprofile-generate=/tmp/ortools_prof\\\"\\ncmake --build build_pgo_gen -j\\n\\n# 2. 跑 corpus（关键：用我们项目的真实负载）\\nmkdir -p /tmp/ortools_prof\\n# corpus 建议（按代表性排序，总跑 30~60 min）：\\n#   - 5 个 valley4 70x70 wave 检查点（小、中、大 Benders 迭代）\\n#   - 1 个 mandatory_exact_instances 全跑\\n#   - 1 个 routing_subproblem 紧张 case\\n#   - 1 个 binding_subproblem 退化 case\\n#   - 1 个 master_model 仅占位无路由 case\\n# ⚠️ 不要混入 unsat 早退案例（分布偏差大，会反优化）\\npython main.py --campaign-hours 1.0 --pgo-corpus  # 你需要加这个 flag 让 outer 自动跑代表样本\\n\\n# 3. 合并 .profraw\\nllvm-profdata-18 merge -output=/tmp/ortools.profdata /tmp/ortools_prof/*.profraw\\n\\n# 4. Stage 2: optimized build\\ncmake -S . -B build_pgo_use -G Ninja \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DBUILD_DEPS=ON -DBUILD_PYTHON=ON \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=clang-18 -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++-18 \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_INTERPROCEDURAL_OPTIMIZATION=ON \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS=\\\"-O3 -march=native -mtune=native -flto=thin -fprofile-use=/tmp/ortools.profdata -Wno-backend-plugin -DNDEBUG\\\" \\\\\\n  -DCMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS=\\\"-flto=thin -fprofile-use=/tmp/ortools.profdata\\\"\\ncmake --build build_pgo_use -j\\n\\n# 5. （可选）BOLT post-link\\nperf record -e cycles:u -j any,u -o perf.data -- ./build_pgo_use/bin/sat_runner ...\\nperf2bolt build_pgo_use/lib/libortools.so -p perf.data -o ortools.bolt.fdata\\nllvm-bolt build_pgo_use/lib/libortools.so -o libortools.bolt.so -data=ortools.bolt.fdata \\\\\\n  -reorder-blocks=ext-tsp -reorder-functions=hfsort+ -split-functions -split-all-cold -split-eh -dyno-stats\\n\\n# 6. 安装到 venv\\ncmake --install build_pgo_use --prefix ~/.local/ortools_pgo\\npip install build_pgo_use/python  # 或对应 wheel\\n```\\n\\n### Windows + clang-cl / MSVC 路径\\n\\n- 用 `clang-cl` 比 MSVC 自带 PGO 体验好（参考 JetBrains 实测 clang-cl LTO+PGO = 35% 提速）。\\n- Stage 1 flag：`-Xclang -fprofile-instr-generate`\\n- MSVC 原生路径：`/GL /LTCG:PGINSTRUMENT` → 跑 corpus → `/LTCG:PGOPTIMIZE`\\n- 注意：x64 Native Tools Command Prompt，路径不能含空格（OR-Tools 官方明确警告）。\\n- BOLT 不可用（Windows 无 perf）。\\n\\n### Corpus 大小经验值\\n\\n- LLVM 自身 PGO corpus 大概 ~5 min check-clang + 一个完整 LLVM rebuild。\\n- 我们 70×70 + 266 设施一个完整 wave 大概 30-90 min，**跑 5-10 个有代表性的 wave 就够**（总 corpus 大小 50-200 MB .profraw）。\\n- 关键原则（LLVM 官方）：\\\"PGO does best when the profiles gathered represent how the user plans to use the compiler\\\" — 用真实 valley4 campaign 数据，不要用合成 toy。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 关键链接\\n\\n- [OR-Tools CMake README (stable)](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/cmake/README.md)\\n- [OR-Tools C++ Build on Windows (官方)](https://developers.google.com/optimization/install/cpp/source_windows)\\n- [LLVM PGO 官方教程](https://llvm.org/docs/HowToBuildWithPGO.html)\\n- [JetBrains C++ LTO/PGO 实测对比 (clangd)](https://blog.jetbrains.com/clion/2022/05/testing-3-approaches-performance-cpp_apps/) — clang-cl LTO+PGO = +35%\\n- [LLVM BOLT README](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/main/bolt/README.md)\\n- [BOLT 论文 (Meta，arxiv)](https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.06735) — 编译器类工作负载 +20.4% on top of LTO+FDO\\n- [PGO 综述论文 (arxiv 2507.16649)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.16649) — 通用工作负载 5-30%，分支密集 +13%\\n- [Intel Hardware-PGO](https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/developer/articles/technical/hwpgo.html) — LBR 采样 PGO 拿到 instrumentation 80-93% 收益但 <2% overhead\\n- [CMake CheckIPOSupported](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/module/CheckIPOSupported.html) — 跨平台 LTO 正确写法\\n- [CXX (Rust-C++ FFI)](https://cxx.rs/) — 1.05x overhead，但对我们项目无意义\\n- [CP-SAT Primer \\\"Under the hood\\\"](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/07_under_the_hood.html) — 确认 CP-SAT 是 LCG 架构\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 对我们项目的优先级建议\\n\\n**第一档（值得做，ROI 高）：**\\n1. **`-march=native + -flto=thin + LTO via CMake INTERPROCEDURAL_OPTIMIZATION`**：低工程量，预期 +6~12%，Linux/Windows 都能拿。先做这个验证整个自编流水线。\\n2. **PGO（用真实 valley4 corpus）**：在 (1) 之上再叠 +5~10%。工程量 1~2 天。但必须 Linux + Clang 走通才稳定，Windows MSVC PGO 流水线脆弱。\\n\\n**第二档（看情况）：**\\n3. **Linux 迁移 + BOLT**：BOLT 只在 Linux 有，post-link 再 +5~8%。和 Round 2 提的 Linux 迁移耦合。如果你已经在做 Linux 路径，把 BOLT 算进去；如果不迁，就跳过。\\n4. **OR-Tools 9.15 → main 主线**：自编已经必须 git clone，顺手追主线能拿 propagator 上游修复，但和编译器优化无关。\\n\\n**第三档（明确不做，浪费时间）：**\\n5. **Cython / Numba / Rust 重写 outer**：你的 outer search loop Python 占比 < 1%，瓶颈是 OR-Tools C++ 内部。重写 0 收益。\\n6. **JIT 专用 propagator**：学术原型，没有可用工程接入。\\n7. **AVX-512 / AVX-VNNI 改造**：13900KS 无 AVX-512，AVX-VNNI 是 INT8 神经网络指令，对 SAT propagator 无用。\\n8. **追求 auto-vectorization on propagator**：watched literal lookup 是控制流密集 + 间接寻址，编译器 vectorize 不到 hot path。`-march=native` 已经把能拿的 SIMD 拿到了。\\n\\n**总收益预估**：在 Windows 不动 OS 的前提下，自编 OR-Tools + march=native + LTO + PGO 大约 **+10~20%**。叠加 Linux 迁移 + BOLT 大约 **+15~30%**。这跟 Round 2 的 +15~35% 估计吻合，且能把\\\"Linux 红利\\\"和\\\"编译器红利\\\"分清楚——编译器路径占 2/3，OS 路径占 1/3。\\n\\n工程预算建议：先花 1 天把 `march=native + LTO` 的 CMake 走通跑 benchmark，能看到 +5% 就继续上 PGO，看不到就直接停手，因为 PGO 的 ROI 系数比 LTO 小但工程量大 5x。\"}],\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1161,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1664,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":55703,\"output_tokens\":4689,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":1664},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[{\"input_tokens\":1161,\"output_tokens\":4689,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":55703,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1664,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":1664,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"type\":\"message\"}],\"speed\":\"standard\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011Caotv1i2QnF3RVWMXJLFu\",\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"2bb73892-3b7c-4f11-a17a-61a1dc680f51\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T21:12:28.497Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2ec0c151-8623-4c7f-9568-a00fb67e0f54","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:03:14.659Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c8bd1486-63e7-413d-a1d3-3f756abee979","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
